46e94-1af9-54e7-9a1b-29fb0570cfc8" :question/problem "For two random variables $X$ and $Y,$ we have $\\text{Var}[X]=\\frac{7}{4},$ $\\text{Var}[Y]=\\frac{5}{2},$ and $\\text{Cov}[X,Y]=\\frac{3}{4}.$ Find $\\text{Var}[X-Y].$"] ["question-94546e94-1af9-54e7-9a1b-29fb0570cfc8" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are random variables, then\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X\\pm Y]=\\text{Var}[X]+\\text{Var}[Y]\\pm 2\\text{Cov}[X,Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given data into the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X-Y]=\\frac{7}{4}+\\frac{5}{2}-2\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{11}{4}.\n$$"] ["question-94546e94-1af9-54e7-9a1b-29fb0570cfc8" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-37059df0-2019-5852-bef9-67f5bbc9e447" :answer-field/id #uuid "37059df0-2019-5852-bef9-67f5bbc9e447"] ["answer-f957552d-c41f-567d-88a0-ad5c32655218" :answer/id #uuid "f957552d-c41f-567d-88a0-ad5c32655218"] ["answer-f957552d-c41f-567d-88a0-ad5c32655218" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f957552d-c41f-567d-88a0-ad5c32655218" :answer/value "\\frac{11}{4}"] ["answer-481038a8-d449-5b39-8dda-544960d7f632" :answer/id #uuid "481038a8-d449-5b39-8dda-544960d7f632"] ["answer-481038a8-d449-5b39-8dda-544960d7f632" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-481038a8-d449-5b39-8dda-544960d7f632" :answer/value "\\frac{23}{4}"] ["answer-bafd273d-ce56-5258-8a54-032916d858c7" :answer/id #uuid "bafd273d-ce56-5258-8a54-032916d858c7"] ["answer-bafd273d-ce56-5258-8a54-032916d858c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-bafd273d-ce56-5258-8a54-032916d858c7" :answer/value "\\frac{7}{2}"] ["answer-9f578386-a3d2-544b-abed-42030e1016dc" :answer/id #uuid "9f578386-a3d2-544b-abed-42030e1016dc"] ["answer-9f578386-a3d2-544b-abed-42030e1016dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9f578386-a3d2-544b-abed-42030e1016dc" :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}"] ["answer-e9f70f08-c5c2-55d3-9f31-b5f42ea6e420" :answer/id #uuid "e9f70f08-c5c2-55d3-9f31-b5f42ea6e420"] ["answer-e9f70f08-c5c2-55d3-9f31-b5f42e