634a7a414f"] [17592186188359 :knowledge-point/questions "question-079f02ad-9ee0-58ac-bead-d4394104b125"] ["question-d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933" :question/id #uuid "d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933"] ["question-d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933" :question/math-academy-id "q-148329"] ["question-d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933" :question/problem "For two random variables $X$ and $Y,$ we have $\\text{Var}[X]=3,$ $\\text{Var}[Y]=5,$ and $\\text{Cov}[X,Y]=1.$ Find $\\text{Var}[3X-4Y].$"] ["question-d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if $X$ and $Y$ are random variables, and $a$ and $b$ are constants, then\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[aX+bY]={a}^{2}\\text{Var}[X]+{b}^{2}\\text{Var}[Y]+2ab\\,\\text{Cov}[X,Y].\n$$\n\nSubstituting the given data into the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[3X-4Y] & ={3}^{2}\\cdot 3+(-4)^{2}\\cdot 5+2\\cdot 3\\cdot (-4)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =27+80-24 \\\\  & =83.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-d139a777-1244-5988-9682-4e7da954d933" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-44a50128-f069-562c-b225-44f83d8c3770" :answer-field/id #uuid "44a50128-f069-562c-b225-44f83d8c3770"] ["answer-1fe11208-1cf5-5ebb-b9ae-1cfd9d864264" :answer/id #uuid "1fe11208-1cf5-5ebb-b9ae-1cfd9d864264"] ["answer-1fe11208-1cf5-5ebb-b9ae-1cfd9d864264" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-1fe11208-1cf5-5ebb-b9ae-1cfd9d864264" :answer/value "64"] ["answer-5212a1f4-14ce-5363-9b60-7fca91d0f9cc" :answer/id #uuid "5212a1f4-14ce-5363-9b60-7fca91d0f9cc"] ["answer-5212a1f4-14ce-5363-9b60-7fca91d0f9cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-5212a1f4-14ce-5363-9b60-7fca91d0f9cc" :answer/value "66"] ["answer-3ed17f21-46a7-5c9d-badf-51e6f9909dd1" :answer/id #uuid "3ed17f21-46a7-5c9d-badf-51e6f9909dd1"] ["answer-3ed17f21-46a7-5c9d-badf-51e6f9909dd1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-3ed17f21-46a7-5c9d-badf-51e6f9909dd1" :answer/value "72"] ["answer-5b321d10-02bd-5f8b-9dc8-387f61a07